<title>UK: World Bank sets NZ$100 million one-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets NZ$100 million one-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CIBC Wood Gundy and Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.25 PCT  MATURITY    02.DEC.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.755   PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  ONE PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIP     0.10</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
